{"text":"Seis meses sem trocar o óleo? Seu cliente não sumiu, cara. Esqueceu. E quem lembra ele primeiro leva o serviço. No BoxMonitor, você cadastra a troca de óleo com a periodicidade, tipo a cada seis meses. Aí, tipo quinze dias antes de vencer, o BoxMonitor avisa o cliente sozinho. Sem mensagem na mão, sem planilha. Ele lembra de quem? De você, sabe? Salva esse vídeo. Daqui a seis meses você me agradece.","voice":"YU8EsJtXFMyKMxYtheDk","settings":"{\"stability\":0.45,\"similarity_boost\":0.8,\"style\":0.3,\"use_speaker_boost\":true,\"speed\":1.05}","seconds":23.684,"charStarts":[0,0.104,0.221,0.302,0.348,0.43,0.476,0.592,0.639,0.697,0.72,0.743,0.766,0.859,0.894,0.952,0.998,1.057,1.115,1.184,1.254,1.277,1.324,1.347,1.463,1.556,1.637,1.66,1.753,1.8,1.939,1.997,2.078,2.113,2.148,2.206,2.264,2.287,2.334,2.38,2.426,2.461,2.519,2.554,2.589,2.624,2.67,2.717,2.798,2.856,2.937,2.984,3.019,3.042,3.088,3.204,3.262,3.286,3.309,3.332,3.379,3.448,3.483,3.506,3.576,3.646,3.762,3.878,3.947,4.063,4.145,4.214,4.238,4.261,4.319,4.342,4.4,4.435,4.481,4.528,4.574,4.632,4.656,4.679,4.725,4.772,4.807,4.853,4.888,4.934,4.992,5.039,5.074,5.097,5.155,5.19,5.224,5.248,5.329,5.364,5.387,5.41,5.433,5.492,5.526,5.608,5.689,5.782,5.898,5.979,6.037,6.06,6.095,6.153,6.2,6.281,6.351,6.49,6.629,6.792,6.885,6.943,7.001,7.07,7.14,7.221,7.279,7.396,7.454,7.523,7.581,7.616,7.686,7.732,7.848,7.93,8.046,8.104,8.15,8.22,8.243,8.266,8.29,8.359,8.417,8.487,8.545,8.603,8.649,8.696,8.731,8.777,8.893,9.009,9.079,9.102,9.125,9.16,9.195,9.218,9.253,9.288,9.311,9.369,9.416,9.497,9.532,9.578,9.625,9.683,9.718,9.752,9.845,9.903,10.019,10.089,10.205,10.252,10.344,10.414,10.507,10.565,10.588,10.612,10.635,10.67,10.704,10.797,10.855,10.89,10.96,11.006,11.122,11.192,11.227,11.308,11.355,11.471,11.529,11.598,11.68,11.726,11.865,12.005,12.121,12.179,12.214,12.283,12.399,12.469,12.527,12.643,12.666,12.736,12.817,12.875,12.934,12.992,13.061,13.119,13.235,13.305,13.34,13.41,13.456,13.502,13.537,13.607,13.63,13.665,13.688,